flowchart LR
    subgraph caller["Every agent callee, on every inbound call"]
        direction TB
        S1["1. Signature / issuer / expiry<br/>EntraJWTValidator (JWKS)"]
        S2["2. Audience — minted for ME?<br/>anti-replay"]
        S3["3. idtyp == 'app'<br/>really a machine token?"]
        S4["4. Caller in MY allow-list?<br/>registry call graph"]
        S5["5. Caller holds Agent.Invoke?<br/>app role"]
